  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Conceito_Crise
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Ciclos viciosos
  _titleEn: Vicious circles
  _category: 2
  _unlockTrigger: 2
  _summary: "Quando um setor est\xE1 muito fragilizado, os problemas se alimentam:
    um servi\xE7o ruim afasta quem paga impostos, o que piora o servi\xE7o. No jogo,
    um par\xE2metro em crise sofre mais com as press\xF5es e recebe menos ajuda dos
    outros."
  _summaryEn: 'When a sector is badly weakened, problems feed on each other: a poor
    service drives away taxpayers, which makes the service worse. In the game, a
    parameter in crisis suffers more from pressure and gets less help from the others.'
  _realWorld: "Detroit perdeu mais da metade da popula\xE7\xE3o desde 1950; com menos
    arrecada\xE7\xE3o e servi\xE7os piores, a cidade decretou fal\xEAncia em 2013."
  _realWorldEn: Detroit lost more than half its population after 1950; with less
    revenue and worse services, the city filed for bankruptcy in 2013.
  _tradeOffs: "Sair de um ciclo vicioso custa muito mais do que evit\xE1-lo; agir
    cedo \xE9 mais barato."
  _tradeOffsEn: Escaping a vicious circle costs far more than avoiding it; acting
    early is cheaper.
  _sources:
  - Label: Vicious circle (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vicious_circle
  - Label: Detroit bankruptcy (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Detroit_bankruptcy
